WEBVTT

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.790
Oh, this is delicious.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:23.520
And the weather is great today, too.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:26.490
Fuwari!

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:27.210
Huh?

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.040
Huh? You want me to do a concert with SoLaMi Smile?

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.090
That's right-pri.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:38.760
It would make me really happy if you would form a Dream Team with us!

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.520
Dream Team?

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:47.150
A Dream Team is a five person team who performs a Theatre Concert in the Dream Theatre.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:51.480
I'm certain we'd get along perfectly, Fuwari-chan.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.660
Crap! SoLaMi Smile got to her first!

00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:00.890
It's regrettable that we let them take the initiative.

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:05.220
I think Fuwari-chan would get along with us as well.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.710
Tch. Looks like everyone had the same idea.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.190
Anyway, I'll make sure that Fuwari joins Alomagedon!

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:13.550
Neko?

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.560
PriPara Museum is reopening-nekon?

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:21.970
I just got a great idea-nekon.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.910
The Demon Museum-kuma!

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:02.870
My, is this a present from Hibiki-sama?!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:07.340
The Making Drama "Shine! Gorgeous Celeb Princess!"

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:11.790
This must be the Making Drama Hibiki-sama wants you to do.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:15.930
Yeah, I think it fits me perfectly.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:20.590
It's several times better than the Making Drama I had in mind.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:25.840
It's such a wonderful and gorgeous Making Drama!

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:28.020
I wouldn't expect anything less from Hibiki-sama!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:32.430
With that, you'll be starting your special training today, Midorikaze Fuwari-san

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:34.610
Let's get this exciting training going!

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:35.370
Let's!

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:36.100
All right.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:37.810
Now then, where should we start?

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:41.320
W-Well, the theme is  gorgeous celeb princess so...

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.410
An invitation?

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:47.460
You have been invited to the Angel Museum.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:51.370
Why not learn more about Making Dramas at the PriPara Museum?

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:53.000
Eh?

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.860
Did something happen?

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.010
Oh, it's nothing.

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:59.760
All right, let's get started right away.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:00.470
All right.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.430
And un, deux, trois.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.680
Un, deux, trois.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.920
Look at your hands.

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:05.930
Un, deux, trois.
Yes.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:06.350
Un, deux, trois.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:06.890
Now spin.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:09.350
Hm?

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.970
What's this?

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:11.810
What?

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:16.480
Huh?

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:18.460
What's this?

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:18.940
Hm?

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.400
An invitation?

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:27.370
Come take a tour of PriPara Museum with the popular and natural idol, Fuwari-chan.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:32.340
Maybe you can even become a Dream Team with Fuwari-chan!

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:34.080
A golden opportunity!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.160
Let's not let this chance slip by!

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:36.830
Yeah!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.060
This is our shot at teaming up-pri!

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:40.050
Let's go!

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.690
...to PriPara Museum!

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:46.340
Thou did a wonderful job delivering those invitations.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:50.180
Red bean buns and melon buns are delicious!

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:55.190
Midorikaze Fuwari, thou shall fall into the palm of mine hand.

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:01.200
Fuwari.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.430
We look forward to hanging out with you today!

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:04.150
Pri!

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:07.640
Ah, same here.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.620
Let's have a good time.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:13.700
Of course you guys also came here in hopes of getting Fuwari, huh-pri?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.220
That's our line!

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:18.670
Fuwari belongs to Dressing Parfait after all!

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:19.860
What?!

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:20.850
Huh?!

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:22.840
Don't-kuma!
Don't-usa!
Don't-tori!

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:26.010
Don't go in there!

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.310
What's going on-pri?!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.230
This is the location of the cursed museum,

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:34.770
that is said to have been built on an ancient mascot graveyard-kuma.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:38.940
The zombie mascots who no longer rest in peace will attack you-usa.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:41.150
Cursed museum?!

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.150
Zombie mascots?!

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:47.410
It happened long long ago-kuma.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:52.240
The place where the PriPara Museum was built,

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:55.120
was also a graveyard for mascots abandoned by their idols.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:59.600
The mascots' despair eventually become a curse,

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:03.340
a curse from which the monster Parantula was born-usa.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.790
Those who dare enter this museum...

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:08.550
...shall be surrounded and pursued by mascot zombies...

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.390
...and forced to change into the Cursed Coord.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:15.390
And will in the end be eaten by the Parantula-kuma!
And will in the end be eaten by the Parantula-usa!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.560
Cursed Coord?!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:19.350
The zombie Parantula?!

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:20.880
Don't go-tori!

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:24.360
If you do, Toriko will become fried chicken-tori.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:25.430
Deep fried and crispy-tori!

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:26.170
Twice fried-tori!

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:27.290
Toriko will be delicious-tori!

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:28.590
It's serious-tori!

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:30.450
Toriko is completely serious-tori!

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:31.320
To!

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:34.160
Nooo!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.120
On second thought, I don't want to be eaten-tori!

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:40.400
Curses and such are in fact 100% fictional-pri.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.850
Let's do whatever we can to get Fuwari!

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:43.590
Yeah.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.420
Evil spirits begone!

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.980
If there are zombies, we'll take them out in one fell swoop!

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:51.270
T-There's n-nothing to be scared of!

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:53.430
If you say so, Dorthy.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.560
You heard them, Fuwari!

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.240
Let's go together-pri!

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:57.390
Let's Go!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.340
Eh?

00:06:58.340 --> 00:06:59.850
O-Okay.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:00.600
Wait!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.100
Don't leave me behind!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.400
Wait-kuma!
Wait-usa!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.820
Don't leave Toriko alone-tori!

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:12.160
They have been successfully lured into my trap.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.930
Now they shall fall into my hands!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:16.720
Kya!

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:17.870
Something's there!

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.080
What is it?!

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:22.250
It's a dinosaur exhibit-nano.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.130
Eh?

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.750
It's a Tyrannosaurus-nano!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:29.330
H-hmm! That's how they'll react we scare them.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.480
They're coming-neko.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:31.220
Gel.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.680
This looks like a dinosaur exhibit-pri.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.410
Wow! It's amazing!

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:38.590
It seems ye hath arrived,

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:40.630
my foolish guests.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:44.320
Welcome to my Demon Museum!

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.360
Hello, everyone-nano!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.440
Aloma!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.820
Haven't learned your lesson, have you?

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:52.030
I'm talking to Princess Midorikaze.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.930
Make a contract with my team right now.

00:07:54.930 --> 00:08:00.500
Otherwise the members of SoLaMi Smile and Dressing Parfait shall fall into hell.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.500
Thank you for the invitation.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.200
But, with how I am now,

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.590
I'll only hold you back.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.840
Is that still what you think?

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:12.300
Derodero Derosaimu!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.800
Rise, my servants!

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:17.810
Oh? She's playing the demon again.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.270
What's it going to be this time-pri?

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.520
Zombie!

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:24.840
Something appeared!

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.420
Save me!

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:28.540
Devi!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:32.260
Get out of here already-kuma!
Get out of here already-usa!

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.800
A curse-tori.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:43.830
Those who fail to become managers become cursed mascots-tori.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.810
Pushuu~.

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.290
That looks like fun!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.970
Everyone looks like they're having fun.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:52.630
Fuwari, we've got to get out of here!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:52.920
Huh?

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.260
O-Okay.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.500
What's the meaning of this?!

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:57.780
Hold up-nano!

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:58.390
Huh?

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:01.430
It's Mikan-nano!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.040
Eh?

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.730
Calm down-neko.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:07.530
Those zombies are actually some of my regulars-neko.

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:09.520
<i>Please-nekon!</i>

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.550
<i>I'm busy with work that day-mouse.</i>

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:13.640
<i>Same here-arai.</i>

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:15.270
<i>Me too-kitsune.</i>

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.560
<i>I see-neko.</i>

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:18.120
<i>Eh?</i>

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:21.370
<i>Then pay me for all the drinks you've had up to now-neko!</i>

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:22.580
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:25.790
<i>In that case, be good and listen to what I say-nekon.</i>

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.670
<i>She's a slave driver-arai.</i>

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:31.690
Oh?

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:34.090
So they aren't actually zombies-nano...

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:38.000
Everything's going as prophesied.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.430
I'll do anything to get my hands on the princess!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:46.840
The mascot curse wasn't a joke-kuma.

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:49.520
It really is dangerous in here-usa.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:50.360
Huh?

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:56.030
Parantula, it's here!

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:59.530
W-We're cursed!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:02.990
Hm? Cursed-kuma?
Hm? Cursed-usa?

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:06.130
Cursed-kuma...
Cursed-usa...

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:11.610
However you look at it, those zombies are one of Aloma's tricks-pri.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:15.290
In any case, this really is a collection of the world's wisdom.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:18.090
It's all so interesting-pri.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:18.930
Pri?

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.200
It's the mouth of truth-pri!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:24.240
I've always wanted to put my hand in it once-pri.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:24.890
Pri!

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.230
I-I can't get it out-pri!

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:30.600
As calculated-zombie!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:36.070
The probability of you sticking your hand in it was 99.9%-zombie!

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:44.790
According to my analysis, there's a 99.99999% chance that you're a deadbeat mascot that Neko hired-pri!

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:46.810
Shut it!

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:49.750
I have my grown-up reasons-kitsune!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.580
Take this! The cursed coord!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.840
No!

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.460
Stop! Cut it out-pri!

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:58.010
Squid?!

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.720
A pop and dried squid tentacles...

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.800
What's with this getup?!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.320
Those costumes have been registered for today's concert.

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.270
Eh?

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:10.230
No way!

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.650
There's nothing to be scared of.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:19.150
I found you-zombie!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:23.450
Wh-Why?! What are you going to do to us?!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.700
If you don't dance in this coord,

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:29.410
I'll curse you by biting your ears and turning you blue-zombie.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:33.370
It's not like I'm scared of a curse or anything.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:38.390
I-It's just happened to want to dance around in this outfit.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.180
Hani, hani. Hani, hani....

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.970
If you're going to dance, Dorthy...

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.180
Arai... guma!

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.310
I'll take this into my own hands.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.480
Ara!

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:57.730
Wash away the dirt that clings to it-arai!

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:59.200
You're open!

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:00.740
Evil spirit, begone!

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.490
It's clean again-arai.

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:05.240
Wow, that's beautiful.

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:06.780
Now, Mikan!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:07.990
Right away-nano!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:10.330
Kaboom-nano!

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:15.380
That was fun!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:17.760
I was overconfident.

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:18.840
You're open-araiguma!

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.720
Your hair-araiguma!

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.220
Complete-arai!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:29.750
Do your concert like this-arai.

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.680
Rock bottom.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.840
Well done, Mikan!

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:35.520
That was a lot of fun!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.480
Just you wait, Princess.

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:41.940
Wow, a room of tapestries.

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:44.730
I wonder where everyone else went...

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:47.010
Oh! A weaving loom.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:50.080
This takes me back.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:53.080
My gramps back in the Palps has one in his house.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.080
Weaving loom?

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.130
Yeah.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:59.040
We would often weave tapestries with one.

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:05.570
One of you still remains.

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:06.550
Manaka Lala!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:11.930
Once I defeat thee, I'll have the princess all to myself.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.590
Toriko is here, too-tori.

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:14.640
Aloma!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.610
This isn't the right way to go about this!

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.110
I won't hand Fuwari over!

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.650
Toriko is here, too-tori.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.280
It's foolish to go against a demon.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:24.450
I'll make thee realize that!

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:26.750
Zombie!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:28.940
Parantula!

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:34.010
I have no use for selfish idols!

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.750
Pura~ Pura~!

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.540
Eh?!?!

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:42.500
I am Parantula!

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.970
Parantula!

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:56.290
That's odd-neko.

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:58.650
I didn't make any previous arrangements with Kuma-neko.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:13:59.440
Devi?!

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.730
It's here!

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.440
It's going to eat us!

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:04.150
Hold it-neko!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:06.400
What happened to paying off your drinks-neko?!

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:08.430
N-No way!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:10.620
Amazing, it's the real thing!

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.580
Be nicer to mascots-para!

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:13.660
Watch out!
Be nicer to mascots-para!

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:14.290
Tori!

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.250
Don't be selfish-para!

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:19.880
I'm scared!

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:21.210
This is amusing!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:26.630
This is the curse of a mascot that has been pushed around by their idol-parapara!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.080
This is bad!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:34.970
Pay us better-parapara...

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:35.640
Watch out!

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:36.080
Tori!

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:36.600
Lala!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.270
Stop!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:39.730
Lala!

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:42.200
I can't move...

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:44.450
So tight!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:46.690
Okay, it's not that bad-tori.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:49.400
Parantula-san, please stop this.

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:52.780
I'm tired of hearing the requests of idols-para.

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:57.370
I'll also hogtie you in my web created from the mascot curse-parapara.

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:03.290
Now then, I'll begin my meal with you-para!

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.260
A cursed thread...

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:12.970
Yes. This is the hatred of managers who have been pushed around by their idols until now-para.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:17.180
But it's so pretty.

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.650
What did you just say-para?

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.480
This thread is really beautiful.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:28.490
I want to make a tapestry out of this thread.

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.370
Fuwari?

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:30.030
T-

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:31.910
What?

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:56.550
Look at how pretty it is!

00:15:56.550 --> 00:16:00.680
We sing like this as we weave wool in the Palps too.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:04.890
My cursed thread can be this beautiful-para...

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:06.850
How pretty.

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:09.140
I-It is-para.

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:13.600
This thread really isn't cursed-para.

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:20.260
It really is the pure feelings of the mascots cheering on their idols-para.

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:26.080
Every mascot always cheers on their idol from the bottom of their heart-para.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.660
Good job-tori!

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:33.610
Parantula-san...

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:35.110
Congratulations.

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:36.010
Huh?

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:40.770
We would like to put that tapestry on display in the PriPara museum.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.680
O-Oh, thank you very much.

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:47.960
I suppose being able to fight off Parantula is something a princess scholarship students would be able to do.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:49.960
Though, I suppose it was a bit different here.

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:52.240
Mikan's starving!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.980
I really want to form a team with Fuwari!

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:00.490
Where are we?

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.660
Where-usa?

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:02.830
Eh?!

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:06.380
Parantula was actually Kuma-san and Usagi-san?!

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:08.780
What are you talking about-kuma?

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:10.380
My head hurts-usa.

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:14.340
So you two were the masterminds behind this, huh-pri?!

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:18.180
How dare you force me to wear this!

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.810
Time for a beat down!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.770
Could this be...

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:26.230
...the idol curse-kuma?!
...the idol curse-usa?!

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:30.820
Could the Parantula's curse really have been true-nekon?

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:33.690
Well, not like I really care either way-nekon.

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:35.900
Capturing Fuwari may have failed,

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:38.000
but I got a hint for a new Making Drama!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.740
That's great!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.160
This is delicious!

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:49.330
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:52.590
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.590
Coord Change Start!

00:17:57.310 --> 00:17:59.970
The Museum has changed some of your coord.

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:03.470
There is art on display in your blue sky pattern skirt.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.060
Blue Sky Museum Amazing Coord!

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:07.430
Devi!

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:14.150
You can't help but feel the history that stems from the engravings depicted on the dusk pattern top!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:17.240
Dusk Pattern Museum Amazing Coord!

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:18.910
Gelrun!

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:23.080
Aloma and...

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:23.980
...Mikan.

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:25.790
An angel and demon...

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:28.600
...shall take you to heaven.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:30.360
No, to hell.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:47.290
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.700
This is exciting!

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:54.340
Give me back my treasure-kuma!

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:56.920
Save me!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:02.300
Give me back my treasure-kuma!

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.300
Here it is!

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:08.370
The Amazing Museum...

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:11.310
...of Mystery!

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:15.280
Cyalume Change!

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:03.290
Thank you-nano!

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:04.200
Bow down before me!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:09.350
It's pretty cunning of those two to actually take today's events and adapt them into a Making Drama-pri.

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:10.630
I'm impressed.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:13.000
Wow.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:16.170
Their plans may have failed,

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:19.520
but they got something positive out of it. They have my respect.

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:22.950
Like I said, I wasn't scared!

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:24.760
I really wasn't!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:27.920
Someday... Someday I'll make sure to...

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:30.780
...perform a gorgeous Making Drama.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:33.560
Please watch over me, Prince-sama.

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:08.400
Why aren't you happy, Fuwari-chan?

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:10.990
I received a new Making Drama from Prince-sama,

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:13.240
but I'm worried if I can do it.

00:23:13.770 --> 00:23:17.160
Am I really worthy of being a princess?

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:18.880
Don't waver!

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:20.540
I want you to believe in me.

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:21.670
Prince-sama!

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:24.830
I'll show you the World of Princesses.

00:23:24.830 --> 00:23:26.590
Here, follow me.

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:28.130
It's crazy gorgeous!

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:29.280
Next time:

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:32.080
A Date with Prince and the Goat.

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:33.340
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:34.800
Let's go PriPara!
